{
  "summary": "This experiment tested replacing the RNA encoder with pca_n2000 in a multimodal multiprofile setup using ViT and concat fusion, isolating its impact compared to scvi_n200. Validation accuracy of 0.6287 is lower than the ViT-based scvi_n200 baseline (0.7150) but higher than some singleprofile baselines, suggesting RNA encoder choice may influence performance. The role of aggregation or fusion methods remains unisolated, and the exact contribution of pca_n2000 versus scvi_n200 is uncertain without direct comparison to other design choices."
}

